This repository carries two licences, because it holds two different kinds of
work.

  Software  — the `shedding_hub` package, the scripts, and the extraction
              notebooks: MIT, in full below.

  Data      — everything under `data/`, including the curated dataset YAML
              files and the schema: Creative Commons Attribution 4.0
              International (CC BY 4.0). See LICENSE-DATA.

Attribution is a condition of reusing the data. Individual datasets are
extracted from published studies; citing Shedding Hub does not relieve you of
citing the source study, which every dataset records.

